{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫處境劇《愛．回家之三代同糖》今晚（12 日）最新一集「心動的信號」，將迎來虐心又心跳加速的轉折！</p><p>劇情講述李偉健(Terry)為了幫車婉婉減輕經濟負擔，竟然忍痛割愛，將自己的心血結晶《圓嬤嬤正傳》版權賣給許俊豪，被迫畫續集《圓妃傳》。</p><p>另邊</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T12:23:53.018332+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T12:01:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033088+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:15.033088+00:00","content_hash":"aa7212bea51a0355f1bc363436539acb1a7e465d711d1d855963eceba0e99004","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}